# Scream Puff: the Food comes only from combat damage dealt to a player (CR 603.2). Blocked by Grizzly Bears, its
# deathtouch damage goes to the Bears, so no Food is made and the defending player keeps their life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Scream Puff
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Scream Puff.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Scream Puff > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Scream Puff)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp; Scream Puff
Bot1.Battlefield.Scream Puff.Damage = 2
